      industryBenchmarks: 'Q3 2025 data; updated annually per Topic review cadence. Triangulated across Salesforce State of Sales 2024 (8th edition), OpenView Partners 2024 SaaS Benchmarks, ICONIQ Growth State of SaaS 2024, SaaS Capital SaaS Metrics Guide, Pavilion Sales Benchmarks, ChartMogul SaaS Benchmark Report, Vitally CSM Benchmark Report, TSIA Support Operations 2024 expansion data, and Gainsight Customer Success benchmarks.',
